# GI-SHADE-DARK (field): FIELD_Barn under SoftwareTraced GI - the trees' shadows on the field carry the sky's colour
# through the cards' radiosity probes (UE LumenRadiosity port), never black. Opened as GRASS-SETTLE.scn opens it.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
Дано run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method SoftwareTraced"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Entity "Sun"
Дано --subject selection set SunElevation 40
Дано --subject selection set SunAzimuth 20
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Тогда-вид 3_field the field on SoftwareTraced GI: tree shadows carry the sky's colour, not black
Когда run View "View mode: Lumen Scene (Lit)"
Тогда-вид 3b_field_lumen_lit the field's lit cards: shaded sides not black
